#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Resize"
msgstr "调整大小"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid ""
"A plugin to resize windows by dragging them from any part (not just the "
"edges)."
msgstr "通过拖动窗口任意位置（不只是边缘）来调整窗口大小的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Activate"
msgstr "激活"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the specified button is held down, you can drag a window to resize it."
msgstr "按住指定按钮时，可以拖动窗口来调整其大小。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Minimum view width"
msgstr "窗口最小宽度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "If set, views cannot be resized smaller than this width."
msgstr "如果设置，窗口宽度不能调整到小于此值。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Minimum view height"
msgstr "窗口最小高度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "If set, views cannot be resized smaller than this height."
msgstr "如果设置，窗口高度不能调整到小于此值。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Activate resize while preserving aspect"
msgstr "保持宽高比调整大小"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"When the specified button is held down, you can drag a window to resize it "
"while preserving its original aspect."
msgstr "按住指定按钮时，可以拖动窗口调整大小并保持原始宽高比。"
